4.5.2 - 2026-11-05

- Fix bottle creation and configuration using system Wine instead of the selected
  downloaded runner, including the failure to configure 32-bit bottles with a
  system Wine installation that supports only WoW64.
- Use the selected Wine runner and matching wineserver consistently for bottle
  operations, application launches, Winetricks and generated desktop shortcuts.
- Report incomplete custom Wine installations instead of silently falling back
  to system Wine.
- Automatically repair identifiable WineGUI-managed shortcuts and preserve
  literal paths and arguments when launching them.
- Extend regression coverage for runner selection, configuration failures,
  detached launches and desktop shortcuts.

Earlier release notes:
https://gitlab.melroy.org/melroy/winegui/-/releases
